- Data minimization and privacy compliance
- Telemetry design and cost optimization
- Index sizing and update cadence
- Break-even analysis and milestone-driven go/no-go criteria

## Code Example
```javascript
function computeCBA(params) {
  const storageCost = params.indexMB * 0.15;
  const energyCost = params.annualWh * 0.0003;
  const telemetryCost = params.dailyTelemetryKB * 365 * 0.00001;
  const privacyAuditCost = params.userCount * 0.10;

  return {
    storageCost,
    energyCost,
    telemetryCost,
    privacyAuditCost,
    totalYear1Cost: storageCost + energyCost + telemetryCost + privacyAuditCost
  };
}
```

